DESCRIPTION:Seniors\, never got a chance to see the lemurs during your tim
 e at Duke? Now's your chance! Senior donors to Jewish Life at Duke throug
 h the Duke Senior Giving Campaign are invited to celebrate their senior y
 ear with our special appreciation event\, Lox and Lemurs! Join us for a f
 ull-spread bagel brunch on the Freeman Center Patio and then head to our 
 exclusive guided walking tour at the Duke Lemur Center.  \n\nSeniors who 
 make a senior gift to Jewish Life at Duke are eligible for this donor app
 reciation event. Interested?  \n\nMake a senior gift to Jewish Life at Du
 ke by visiting www.tinyurl.com/JLDSenior\, via Flex at duke.is/JLDSeniorF
 lex\, or the Duke Mobile App with Apple Pay/Google Pay. Consider donating
  $18 to signify "chai\," meaning life in Hebrew\, or $20.26 in honor of y
 our class year! Donations of $100+ make you a Senior Leadership Donor. Gi
 fts of $5+ qualify seniors to attend JLD's annual senior donor appreciati
 on event\, Lox & Lemurs. \n\nSend a screenshot of your donation confirmat
 ion to jewishlife@duke.edu \n\nCheck your email inbox for your exclusive 
 invitation link!   \n\nNote: Lemur Center Tour spots are limited\, so RSV
 Ps for the tour will close when capacity is reached\; however\, all senio
 r donors are invited to the bagel brunch (no capacity limit). \n\nQuestio
 ns? Contact jewishlife@duke.edu
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T150000
