 ancy\, a distinguished professor at Texas Tech University and the author 
 of Saving Us: A Climate Scientist's Case for Hope and Healing in a Divide
 d World. Join the Duke Climate Commitment for a fireside chat with Dr. Ha
 yhoe and Dean Lori Bennear of the Nicholas School of the Environment. Thi
 s event is free and open to all.
