DESCRIPTION:Join us this month for a conversation about the nature of both
  poisons and poisoners in our everyday lives\, including topics ranging f
 rom forensics to food safety\, and public health to homicide.\n\nDeborah 
 Blum is a Pulitzer-prize winning science journalist\, the best-selling au
 thor of six books\, and a writer with a long-standing interest in poison\
 , in our everyday lives\, in our history and in far too many murders.
DURATION:PT1H
